    {
      "package": "postext",
      "note": "a tinted page-span teaser strip (:::callout{type=\"sky\" span=\"page\"}) opens the front page under the nameplate. An opener (a span: 'page' H1) counts as a block of column 1 in 1.18.0, so a float across k columns fenced right after it cannot take the head of column 1 and lands from column 2; the strip opens a new band whose first column is empty, and the lead's headline box and photo take columns 1-4. Pages 2 and 4 open on page-span jump heads for the same reason"
    }
